msgid "Add a domain"
msgstr "Dodaj domen"

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:387
msgid "Point a domain to your account and start hosting it."
msgstr "Usmerite domen ka vašem nalogu i počnite da ga hostujete."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:394
msgid "Upload your website files using the file manager."
msgstr "Otpremite fajlove vašeg sajta pomoću menadžera fajlova."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:401
msgid "Set up a new database and user with the database wizard."
msgstr ""
"Podesite novu bazu podataka i korisnika pomoću čarobnjaka za baze podataka."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:407
msgid "Add a website"
msgstr "Dodaj sajt"

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:408
msgid "Install WordPress or another app with the auto-installer."
msgstr "Instalirajte WordPress ili drugu aplikaciju pomoću auto-instalera."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:419
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Propusti"

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:422
#: internal/web/templates/domains/redirect.html:148
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Nastavi"

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:423
msgid "Please wait…"
msgstr "Sačekajte…"

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:446
msgid ""
"Recommended for websites that rely on .htaccess, Apache rewrite rules, and "
"Apache-specific configurations."
msgstr ""
"Preporučeno za sajtove koji se oslanjaju na .htaccess, Apache pravila za "
"prepisivanje i konfiguracije specifične za Apache."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:451
msgid ""
"Recommended for Node.js and Python applications, static websites, and high-"
"traffic sites requiring efficient resource usage."
msgstr ""
"Preporučeno za Node.js i Python aplikacije, statične sajtove i sajtove sa "
"velikim saobraćajem kojima je potrebna efikasna upotreba resursa."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:456
msgid ""
"Recommended for WordPress and PHP websites that need high performance and "
"built-in caching, but only one PHP version."
msgstr ""
"Preporučeno za WordPress i PHP sajtove kojima su potrebne visoke performanse"
" i ugrađeno keširanje, ali samo jedna PHP verzija."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:491
msgid ""
"Nginx-based web server with Lua scripting support, ideal for advanced "
"configurations and custom request processing."
msgstr ""
"Veb server zasnovan na Nginx-u sa podrškom za Lua skripte, idealan za "
"napredne konfiguracije i prilagođenu obradu zahteva."

#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:496
msgid ""
"Recommended for high-performance WordPress, PHP, and eCommerce websites. "
"Offers excellent Apache compatibility, advanced caching, and efficient "
"handling of high traffic."
msgstr ""
"Preporučeno za WordPress, PHP i eCommerce sajtove visokih performansi. Nudi "
"odličnu kompatibilnost sa Apache-om, napredno keširanje i efikasno "
"upravljanje velikim saobraćajem."

